      "mergeID": "6a034deabc8344b48a460a6b",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When I change scale on individual axes, sometimes accidentally, an item can end up with non-uniform scaling and produce strange visuals.\n\nHowever, resetting the transform also resets the accessory’s rotation and position, which is not what I want.\n\nSimilarly, when I rotate an accessory unexpectedly, I may want to reset only the rotation, but that is currently impossible.\n\nPlease provide buttons to reset rotation and scale individually.\n\nFor scale, it might also be useful to have a button to normalize non-uniform scaling back to uniform scaling.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1832]  Individual Reset for Scale and Rotation in the Accessory Editor",
