  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-03-04T21:14:08.468Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\n\nCurrently, you can only fully reset an accessory, which resets everything:\n\n- X,Y,Z Position\n\n- X,Y,Z Rotation\n\n- X,Y,Z Scale\n\n- Custom Settings, e.g. Color\n\nThis makes it really annoying if you e.g. by accident move and accessory on the wrong axis which makes off centre.\n\n# Suggestion:\n\nAdd a little \"reset arrow\" button to the X, Y and Z labels of each slider for position, rotation and scale, to allow us to reset each axis individually.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a very bad mock-up on what this could look like :D",
